E('reintegrate','英 /riːˈɪntɪɡreɪt/','重新整合；重新融入','曾经分开或离开过，现在把连接重新建立起来。','re- 再次、回到原状 + integrate；英语内部构词。',INTEGRATE+[['英语 re- + integrate → reintegrate','整合 → 重新整合、重新融入']],'reintegrate staff into a team 是帮助员工回到团队；reintegrate systems 是把拆开或独立的系统重新接好。into 后面接重新加入的整体。','reintegrate into society；reintegrate into the team；reintegrate separate systems。','return 只是回来；reintegrate 还关心能否重新参与、配合和建立联系。',('The club helped injured players reintegrate into the team.','俱乐部帮助受过伤的球员重新融入球队。'),('We need to reintegrate the separate databases after the merger.','合并后，我们需要重新整合这些分开的数据库。'),sources=['https://www.etymonline.com/word/reintegrate','https://www.collinsdictionary.com/dictionary/english/reintegrate']),
